# NOTE: .env and settings.json are deliberately NOT ignored.
# The deployment panel clones this repo and runs it as-is, so the config has to
# travel with the code. That puts API keys in the repository history —
# KEEP THIS REPOSITORY PRIVATE.

# Python
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
*$py.class
*.so
*.egg
*.egg-info/
